## Expected Business Benefits

The proposed Student Registration System is expected to provide the following benefits:

- Reduce manual registration work for university staff.
- Reduce errors caused by incorrect module selections.
- Automatically identify prerequisite issues.
- Automatically identify timetable clashes.
- Reduce the number of registration problems requiring advisor assistance.
- Improve the student registration experience.
- Provide faster registration and confirmation.
- Improve the accuracy of student registration records.

## Success Measures

The success of the proposed solution could be measured using:

- Average time required to complete registration.
- Number of registration errors.
- Number of timetable conflicts detected.
- Number of students requiring manual assistance.
- Percentage of successful registrations.
- Student satisfaction with the registration process.
